orked on.","ar":"موقع الصيانة هو المكان الذي تُصلح فيه سيارة واحدة."},"id":"L004"},{"actor":"maher","start":21.298,"text":{"en":"Look at the front of the car. What is this part called?","ar":"انظر إلى مقدّمة السيارة. ما اسم هذا الجزء؟"},"id":"L005"},{"actor":"maher","start":32.213,"text":{"en":"The engine. The engine makes the car move.","ar":"المحرّك. المحرّك يجعل السيارة تتحرّك."},"id":"L006"},{"actor":"maher","start":37.881,"text":{"en":"And this one, beside the engine. What is it?","ar":"وهذا، بجانب المحرّك. ما هو؟"},"id":"L007"},{"actor":"maher","start":47.838,"text":{"en":"The battery. It stores electricity to start the car.","ar":"البطارية. تخزّن الكهرباء لتشغيل السيارة."},"id":"L008"},{"actor":"tarek","start":54.298,"text":{"en":"Ustaz, what do we call the cover over the engine?","ar":"أستاذ، ماذا نسمّي الغطاء فوق المحرّك؟"},"id":"L009"},{"actor":"tarek","start":63.996,"text":{"en":"The bonnet. In American English they say hood. Both are correct.","ar":"غطاء المحرّك. في الإنجليزية الأمريكية يقولون hood. كلاهما صحيح."},"id":"L010"}],"subtitles":{"enabled":true,"langs":"en,ar","show":null,"lang":{}},"badgePlacement":{"x":"0.016","y":"0.016","width":"0.205"},"audio":{"master":"audio.m4a","lines":[{"key":"02908170d2250803","bytes":28224,"sha":"7713b133c6bacd5b","address":"lines/02908170d2250803.mp3"},{"key":"481e44575148a0af","bytes":24192,"sha":"831e445611136d9e","address":"lines/481e44575148a0af.mp3"},{"key":"acf78915f7ea8fb6","bytes":20880,"sha":"0e60adc499fd050b","address":"lines/acf78915f7ea8fb6.mp3"},{"key":"f4085b11cb07535d","bytes":20592,"sha":"b2e73329f457806d","address":"lines/f4085b11cb07535d.mp3"},{"key":"6006277da7d2541e","bytes":28080,"sha":"068630ca7ff598b5","address":"lines/6006277da7d2541e.mp3"},{"key":"1515612f75e92b6e","bytes":26208,"sha":"156be3b54226c72c","address":"lines/1515612f75e92b6e.mp3"},{"key":"0fa174e2d8faada3","bytes":26208,"sha":"75c69a56b861c198","address":"lines/0fa174e2d8faada3.mp3"},{"key":"f4b8e445bb6a0788","bytes":30960,"sha